{"channelId":"UCdLcU80BzAooMSBinZtkqxA","row":["Steven Murdoch Clinical Massage",28,"Hello, I'm Steven, a Jing Method™ clinical massage therapist specialising in chronic musculoskeletal pain. I'm based in North London, UK. \n\nThe Jing Method™ is a holistic treatment which works in harmony with the nervous system. \n\nThe aim of the Jing Method™ to relieve pain and release restrictions. The method incorporates hot stones, myofascial release, trigger point therapy, acupressure, stretching and personalised self-care.\n\nAs and when I get organised, I'll post some videos of the techniques involved. I also hope to add some self-care videos to help relieve chronic pain issues such as low-back pain, frozen shoulder and plantar fasciitis.","","United Kingdom"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCdLcU80BzAooMSBinZtkqxA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCdLcU80BzAooMSBinZtkqxA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:19.214Z","channelId":"UCdLcU80BzAooMSBinZtkqxA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"76a62684769a2781d50c309c85eaf18ecec7cf3abbf3c94911018e1e0b2654f9","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"18394908309a998e72b87e3fe048cbbf5a499db552fec9184086789d47bdb428"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCdLcU80BzAooMSBinZtkqxA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T08:55:20.843Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCdLcU80BzAooMSBinZtkqxA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":28,"raw":"28 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCdLcU80BzAooMSBinZtkqxA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:19.214Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["massage therapist"],"relevantKeywords":["massage therapist"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"massage therapist","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"practitioner_self_report","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCdLcU80BzAooMSBinZtkqxA